OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after girl, 15, struck by  
OL,4,Acar in hit-and-run                     
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information   
OL,7,Fafter a 15-year-old girl was struck by 
OL,8,Fa car in a hit-and-run in Dundee.      
OL,10,FThe incident happened in the Nethergate
OL,11,Farea of the city at about 20:50 on     
OL,12,FWednesday.                             
OL,14,FThe teenager was crossing the road when
OL,15,Fa white car moved from the junction at 
OL,16,FWhitehall Street towards Chrichton     
OL,17,FStreet where it hit her.               
OL,19,FPolice said the driver failed to stop. 
OL,20,FThe girl was taken to hospital but had 
OL,21,Fno serious injuries.                   
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
